note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Concatenate residency.om and runtime.om before this final native lease root.
note tok4 is retained lease epoch; req0 is current existing session epoch.
fn native_lease p edit ulong 528 req view ulong 16 tok view ulong 16 op ulong to long
if or ne get tok 4 get req 0 eq get tok 1 0
ret -1
end
ret native_cache p req tok op
end
